# interplay_scanout_release_while_paused: The host unplugs a presenting display while the device is paused, with GPU work queued: the detach runs no state machine (the guest display is paused), so the page keeps its modes; the NOP-gated phase waits. unpause runs the machine with no client: 8 (disconnect), mode count 0, state 0; the queued phase runs, and presents to the port complete at once with nothing called. A display plugged in again connects (4, expectedAck 2) and takes the next frame; the second phase equals the first.
